<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title-main top-title">经历详情</view><view class="figma-menu"><image src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse.svg"/><image src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse.svg"/><image src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse.svg"/></view></view>
<view class="row"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:92rpx;height:92rpx">{{post.initial}}</view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:24rpx"><view class="h3">{{post.author}}</view><view class="tiny">8月13日 · 浙江丽水</view></view><view class="chip follow-chip {{followed ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleFollow">{{followed ? '已关注' : '＋关注'}}</view></view><view class="chip-row" style="margin:28rpx 0"><view class="chip">徒步</view><view class="chip">{{post.type}}</view><view class="chip">{{post.stage}}</view></view>
<view class="h2 detail-post-title">{{post.title}}</view><view class="muted detail-content">穿过草木茂密路段后发现小腿有两处红点，<text class="block-break"></text>当时只有轻微瘙痒，没有全身不适。我先用清水<text class="block-break"></text>清洁并冷敷，按两小时提醒复查时没有继续扩大。</view>
<view class="post-map"><image class="post-map-art" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgFrame1.svg" mode="scaleToFill"/><view class="author-route">作者已共享完整路线</view><view class="route-label">{{post.route}}</view><view class="route-view" bindtap="viewRoute">查看路线</view></view><button class="primary-btn detail-safety" bindtap="danger">类似情况？先进行安全判断，不照搬他人处理</button><view class="post-meta"><text bindtap="toggleLike">{{liked ? '♥' : '♡'}} {{post.likes}}</text><text bindtap="focusComment">评论 {{post.comments}}</text><text bindtap="toggleFavorite">{{favorited ? '★ 已收藏' : '☆ 收藏 ' + post.favorites}}</text><text bindtap="share">分享</text></view>
<view class="section-title detail-comments-title">评论</view><view class="card card-pad row detail-comment" wx:for="{{commentList}}" wx:key="id"><image class="figma-icon lg" src="/assets/figma/all/s22-imgEllipse2.svg"/><view class="comment-copy"><view class="tiny">{{item.author}}</view><view class="comment-text">{{item.text}}</view><view class="tiny">{{item.time}} · <text class="comment-reply" data-name="{{item.author}}" bindtap="reply">回复</text></view></view></view><view class="comment-bar"><input class="grow" value="{{comment}}" focus="{{commentFocus}}" bindinput="input" bindblur="blurComment" placeholder="{{commentPlaceholder}}"/><view class="send" bindtap="send">↑</view></view><view class="tiny report-link" bindtap="report">举报</view></view>
